<p><br></p>
<p>* indicates the feature is <strong>email notification &amp; preference e=
nabled, </strong>but only for Compass users for now.&nbsp; Part of 2027 wil=
l be a look into the overall comms revision to include distribution list ma=
nagement, announcements &amp; content.</p>
<p>** Channel takes feature permissions into account, anything setup as a "=
Feature" will Option to be based on user feature subscription</p>
<p>***To be replaced in the future with DL configuration within Compass.</p=
>
<p>Targeted communications</p>
<p>~1K in the DL, includes generic mailboxes</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"816e6018-613b-4521-98ca-15f2b54d0d1a">~700 unique address=
es that do not overlap with email subscription.</li>
</ul>
<p>~1K email subscribers</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3570910e-663b-488f-b4b2-2126b9cfcaf0">~250 users also rec=
eive targeted communications</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3e8c732f-f028-49fd-a120-309e36f2d86c">~400 users receive =
secondary comms from their firm</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"89db90f9-bf69-432f-a52e-9294e825467b">~350 users left if =
email notification is not supported across 45 firms</li>
</ul>
